      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start/tone-wise, but i think it's a bit too short on the actual value. the marketing team is actually pretty picky about the \"feature-rich\" score—they want to see that we are actually showing off the breadth of the platform.\n\ncould you try a version that incorporates more of those features from the list? again, i really don't want it to look like a list of bullet points or a spammy dump, but we need that score to be significantly higher so it doesn't get flagged as \"low value\" by the automation tool. try to weave them in naturally so it still feels like a human wrote it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
